lity set configuration, it is not the best solution for this scenario. The =
requirement is to keep at least eight virtual machines operational during p=
lanned Azure platform maintenance for an application that runs across nine =
virtual machines. A single virtual machine scale set with 10 VM instances p=
rovides a more suitable and scalable design because Azure distributes the i=
nstances across update domains and updates one update domain at a time duri=
ng planned maintenance. This ensures that at most two VMs are affected at a=
 time and at least eight VMs remain operational.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>R=
